cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SNN-IDS: Spiking Neural Network Intrusion Detection on STM32N6 Neural-ART NPU"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "thc1006"
date-released: 2026-03-08
url: "https://github.com/thc1006/TRON_2026"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - spiking-neural-network
  - intrusion-detection-system
  - neural-art-npu
  - stm32n6
  - int8-quantization
  - edge-ai
  - rtos
  - nsl-kdd
abstract: >-
  First hardware-verified deployment of an INT8 quantized ANN
  (mathematically equivalent to T=1 SNN inference) for network
  intrusion detection on the STM32N6570-DK Neural-ART NPU,
  achieving 0.4563ms inference latency at 800MHz.
  Includes QCFS activation comparison experiment demonstrating
  that PASCAL-style SNN activations can also be compiled for
  Neural-ART NPU targets.
